                                                "sense_id": "6c672fb5-3286-3b73-a530-a5fc4bb4d6a8",
                                                "text": "[...] the people of that island erected lofty spars along the seacoast, to which the look-outs ascended by means of nailed cleats, something as fowls go upstairs in a hen-house."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
